sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client as Mobile Client
    participant API as API Gateway
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Client->>API: POST Envelope (Key: IDEMP-100, Digest: SHA_A)
    API->>DB: Check idempotency key IDEMP-100
    DB-->>API: Not found -> Insert envelope & idempotency record
    API-->>Client: 201 Created (Envelope ID 1)

    Note over Client, API: Network retry due to socket drop
    Client->>API: Retry POST Envelope (Key: IDEMP-100, Digest: SHA_A)
    API->>DB: Check idempotency key IDEMP-100
    DB-->>API: Found (Digest matches)
    API-->>Client: 201 Created (Return cached Envelope ID 1, idempotentRetry: true)
